# The root .gitignore's `.env*` pattern would also catch these dev-only,
# non-secret defaults (VITE_WS_HOST=localhost:8787) — re-include them so
# they're tracked. `.env.production` stays ignored by the root pattern: the
# deployed Worker's real host is set at Vercel deploy time, not hardcoded.
# `.env.test` must be tracked, not just local convenience: Vitest defaults
# to mode 'test', so `web/src/lib/wsHost.ts`'s load-time throw-if-unset
# guard fails every test file that imports it on any checkout without one.
!.env.development
!.env.test
